ds, LLC and Anzu Robotics, LLC (collectively, “Drone Nerds”) through XTI Drones Holdings, LLC, a Texas limited liability company (“XTI Drones Holdings”). The Company holds an 83.403% controlling equity interest in XTI Drones Holdings through its ownership of Class A Units, and the remaining 16.597% equity interest is held by other Class B unitholders. The results of Drone Nerds have been included in the Company’s condensed consolidated financial statements from the acquisition date, and the ownership interest not held by the Company is reflected as noncontrolling interest.","context":"EXPLANATORY NOTE","section":"","block":70,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-056270","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-05-14","reportDate":"2026-03-31","cik":"0001529113","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1529113/000121390026056270/ea0289941-10q_xtiaero.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/2cca18decf248f28be4490e1f5a7801ca41ac79ae24de5ddd740be1f278b65e2.bin","sha256":"2cca18decf248f28be4490e1f5a7801ca41ac79ae24de5ddd740be1f278b65e2"}},{"id":"e6ef1ea4f8944fca204fd96d73d9c033ed58413b69ca028d50c6da15bbe01e1c","quote":"In November 2025, the Company completed the acquisition of Drone Nerds, LLC and Anzu Robotics, LLC (collectively, “Drone Nerds”) through XTI Drones Holdings, LLC, a Texas limited liability company (“XTI Drones Holdings”). The Company holds an 83.403% controlling equity interest in XTI Drones Holdings through its ownership of Class A Units, and the remaining 16.597% equity interest is held by other Class B unitholders. The results of Drone Nerds have been included in the Company’s consolidated financial statements from November 10, 2025, the acquisition date, and the ownership interest not held by the Company is reflected as noncontrolling interest. Drone Nerds represents the Company’s primary UAS solutions and services operations.","context":"Organization","section":"Bus